{
  "title": "Zesty Light Jamaican Baby Aubergine Curry",
  "description": "A light and earthy Jamaican curry featuring baby aubergine, this dish is perfect for those looking for a flavorful and crumbly meal without onion or garlic.",
  "cuisine": "Jamaican",
  "diet": [
